<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Norcen on focus list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Norcen on focus list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston said Wednesday it had added Canada's Norcen Energy Resources Ltd to its focus list of stocks.</p>
<p>-- The company kept its rating of buy.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
